This application manages media files directly through the server's filesystem. To add new music to your library, please follow these steps:
Prepare Your Files: Ensure your audio files are in .mp3 format and your cover images are in a common format like .jpg or .png.
Upload Directories: The application uses the uploads/ directory in the project root. Ensure your server has write permissions for these subfolders:
uploads/songs/: Place your music files here.
uploads/covers/: Place your song cover art images here.

Add via Admin Panel:
Log in to the application using an account with Admin privileges.
Navigate to the Admin Dashboard.
Fill in the song details (Title, Artist, Album, Duration).
Upload the music file and cover image using the provided form.

The system will automatically store the files in the appropriate folders and update the MySQL database so the song appears in the main feed.
